<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of products do you photograph?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We photograph a wide variety of products, including fashion apparel, jewellery, cosmetics, skincare, electronics, home d\u00e9cor, food items, accessories, and other consumer goods for ecommerce, catalogues, and advertising."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer 360\u00b0 product photography?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We provide 360\u00b0 product photography that allows customers to view your products from every angle, making your online listings more interactive and engaging."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does a product photography project take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Project timelines depend on the number of products, shoot style, and editing requirements. We offer a 48-hour turnaround on selected packages and provide a clear timeline before the project begins."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you provide photo editing and retouching?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Every image includes professional editing \u2014 colour correction, background removal, dust cleanup, and detailed retouching to ensure a polished final result."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you serve businesses outside Dubai?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. While our product photography studio is based in Dubai, we work with businesses across all seven Emirates, including Abu Dhabi, Sharjah, Ajman, Ras Al Khaimah, Fujairah, and Umm Al Quwain."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you create images for Amazon and other ecommerce platforms?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. We produce marketplace-ready images that meet the requirements of Amazon, Noon, Shopify, and other ecommerce platforms, helping your listings look professional and compliant."}}]}</script>
